    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.38539123535156,
        527.4087524414062,
        235.82838439941406
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV are approximately 19 times more likely to develop TB disease than those without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.960428237915039,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.58534240722656,
        527.5982055664062,
        249.02833557128906
      ],
      "text": "HIV; in 2019, an estimated 44% of people living with HIV who also had TB disease did not reach care,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99804973602295,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        244.9912872314453,
        527.4166259765625,
        262.2283020019531
      ],
      "text": "(1). and 30% of all HIV-related deaths were due to TB  Thus, ensuring early detection and treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.98529052734375,
        524.4046020507812,
        275.4283142089844
      ],
      "text": "for TB among all people living with HIV is crucial for reducing morbidity and mortality in this group.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.6893310546875,
        527.2891845703125,
        297.1323547363281
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation, which applies to people of all ages, was first published in 2011 in WHO’s",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        293.09527587890625,
        527.431884765625,
        310.27728271484375
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines for intensified tuberculosis case-finding and isoniazid preventive therapy for people living",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        306.2952880859375,
        527.397216796875,
        323.5323181152344
      ],
      "text": "with HIV in resource-constrained settings (19) , and it remains in place. The GDG placed high value on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.289306640625,
        527.5926513671875,
        336.7323303222656
      ],
      "text": "ensuring that TB is diagnosed early in this risk group, which has a high likelihood of having undetected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969959259033203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.48931884765625,
        495.2506408691406,
        349.9323425292969
      ],
      "text": "TB and a high risk of poor health outcomes in the absence of early diagnosis and treatment.",
