      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        685.675537109375,
        527.4179077148438,
        700.1185302734375
      ],
      "text": "pooled prevalence of TB disease among all close contacts of TB patients was 3.6% (95% confidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
