      "text": "{21} strongly recommended since 2012 for contacts of individuals with TB disease , given the high",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        725.2755126953125,
        527.4288940429688,
        739.718505859375
      ],
      "text": "prevalence of disease in this population. At the GDG meeting, evidence was also presented on the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
